<title>UK: European Coal &amp; Steel Comm sets 2.8 bln Luf bond.</title>
<headline>European Coal &amp; Steel Comm sets 2.8 bln Luf bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg, Banque et Caisse d'Epargne de l'Etat, Banque Internationale a Luxembourg, Credit Communal/Gemeentekredit and Generale Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN COAL AND STEEL COMMUNITY</p>
<p> AMT    2.8 BLN LUF   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    22.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.85    PAY DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  =	   PRAECIPUUM  0.175</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
